Argument:
  <Conference name>

Description:
  Changes the settings of a conference.

  If no conference name is given, the current conference is changed.

  You can change the conference name, description and type. The
  current settings are shown as defaults. Press ENTER to keep a
  value unchanged.

  The conference description may contain up to 80 characters. If
  the entire description is erased, it is removed.

  If the conference type is FTN, you can also change the FTN domain
  and echo area. If an FTN configuration already exists, its current
  values are shown as defaults.

Note:
  Only the creator of a conference may change its settings.

  The mailbox cannot be changed with this command.

Background:
  This command replaces the previous separate commands for changing
  the conference name and description, and collects the most
  important conference settings in one place.

